  ('k3a_primitiveren', 'k3a_afgeleide', $ksql$Differentieer: $f(x) = x\arctan(x)$$ksql$, $ksql$arctan(x) + x/(x^2 + 1)$ksql$, $ksql$f'(x) = \arctan(x) + \dfrac{x}{x^{2} + 1}$ksql$, 3, 6, ARRAY[$ksql$atan(x) + x/(x^2 + 1)$ksql$, $ksql$x/(x^2 + 1) + arctan(x)$ksql$, $ksql$tan^-1(x) + x/(x^2 + 1)$ksql$]::text[]),
